<title>POLAND: NFI OCTAVA NETS PLN 15.2 MLN IN Q2.</title>
<headline>NFI OCTAVA NETS PLN 15.2 MLN IN Q2.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish mass privatisation fund NFI Octava's initial results for the second quarter of 1997, in million zlotys:</p>
<p>					Q2 1997		    Q2 1996</p>
<p>  Net profit			 15.15		(loss) 38.25</p>
<p>  Investement portfolio	 367.56			379.87</p>
<p>  Liabilities and reserves     29.91			 12.97</p>
<p>  Net assets			356.34			370.63</p>
<p>  Assets per share (PLN)	 10.59			 11.49</p>
<p>NOTE: The company's full name is Narodowy Fundusz Inwestycyjny Octava SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
